    "detailed_description": "Lillysia is a 2D Platforming, Your journey is to deliver vaccines to sick pets.<br>When you jump hit the wall, You can downthrust to landing or break obstacle.<br>You must use these actions to past the obstacles you facing.<br>when you make mistake, You can try again and learn how to avoid mistakes.<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>1.Hold the button and release it to make a long jump.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176030/extras/14f21bc89f3cb5ff8332758a07c1861b.poster.avif?t=1752827800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176030/extras/14f21bc89f3cb5ff8332758a07c1861b.webm?t=1752827800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176030/extras/14f21bc89f3cb5ff8332758a07c1861b.mp4?t=1752827800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>2.When you jump hit the wall, you gain a chance to use downthrust once,<br>this action use for break obstacle or landing from jump.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176030/extras/19f6260fb86047fefedf223648affe8f.poster.avif?t=1752827800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176030/extras/19f6260fb86047fefedf223648affe8f.webm?t=1752827800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176030/extras/19f6260fb86047fefedf223648affe8f.mp4?t=1752827800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>3.Jumping on a bird makes you jump higher.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176030/extras/365702b14339cd6b9d366ce787dbf886.poster.avif?t=1752827800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176030/extras/365702b14339cd6b9d366ce787dbf886.webm?t=1752827800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176030/extras/365702b14339cd6b9d366ce787dbf886.mp4?t=1752827800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>4.Maximum jump distance when you downthrust on a bird.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176030/extras/42271e782d3b5059c6de22df64d93de3.poster.avif?t=1752827800\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176030/extras/42271e782d3b5059c6de22df64d93de3.webm?t=1752827800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2176030/extras/42271e782d3b5059c6de22df64d93de3.mp4?t=1752827800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>5.Auto save every stage.",
